  "_comment": "Shared egress conformance vectors (K4-01). internal/pod/egress_review_test.go checks the konareef scanner against this file. scripts/check_egress_vectors.exs checks the reef-core scanner (EgressDeclaration and EgressScanner at a git ref) against the same file. When both pass, the client and the server agree on every case below. A change here needs a matching change on the other side in a linked MR. scanner_version and policy_version name the reef-core scanner constants these expectations were checked against. Findings are compared as sets, because neither side promises an order. The breadth section (EGRESS-BREADTH, reef-core#87) is checked by internal/pod/egress_breadth_test.go and by reef-core's EgressBreadth parity test; both sides embed the Public Suffix List file that breadth.psl names, and each side fails a test when its embedded file does not have that SHA-256.",
